Dialogu: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,um... {Um...}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:05.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Winter was starting.{Winter starting to begin.} {Winter started to begin.}{<-- redundant?}{Winter was starting. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:09.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}From last spring to fall... {From last spring, to this recent fall... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:12.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I lost half a year's worth of memories. {I lost half a year's worth of memories. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:16.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I heard that I got into a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But I can't even remember that.{But even that I cannot remember.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This past month...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:28.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}the same old days continued. {The same old days continued.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:25.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Haru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.74,0:02:28.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Spacing out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:32.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How do you manage here? It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:38.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:39.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:44.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,During this past month...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:51.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something keeps bothering me. {Something keeps on bothering me. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:54.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something important?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:01.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can't remember... no matter how hard I try. {I can't remember... No matter how hard I try.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:02.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Actually.... {Actually...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:06.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Keisuke, you said it before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was in the Gardening Club before. {I was in the gardening club before.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:10.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right, the Gardening Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:13.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I join the Gardening Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...{W-why you say...}{Aiko: maybe replace with um....}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:19.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It seems that Kisaragi-sensei recommended it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:26.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's what Sensei said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:29.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:34.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When your body gets better, come back to the Gardening Club whenever you can. {When your body improves, come back to the gardening club whenever you can.} {When your body gets better, come back... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:36.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:43.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Akihime, was it? {Um, Akihime, was it?} {Um... Akihime, was it? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right! {Right! It is!} {Yes! You're right! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:46.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime Sumomo! {Akihime Sumomo.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:51.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It was the Gardening Club.{Gardening club it was./It was gardening club.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:05.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:15.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're not pushing yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:19.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:23.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Nako-chan. We'll be late for the afternoon class. {Let's go Nako-chan. We'll be late for the afternoon class. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The properties of a metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,First, malleability. {First, malleability.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:39.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The property of being able to be flattened out into thin sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Second, ductility. {Second, ductility.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:46.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It means the ability of the matter to be stretched long and thin, and to have a special metallic luster. {The property of being able to be stretched long and thing, and have special metallic lust.} {The property of being able to be stretched long and thin, and to have a special metallic luster. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:51.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Also, the amount of heat and electricity that can be transferred... {Also, the amount of heat and electricity that can be transferred...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:51.47,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Haru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:55.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}His body seems healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:57.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:03.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm happy every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:07.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}because the memories are scattered out in many places.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:13.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Every day, I can see Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Haru, you're free after this, right? {You know Haru, you're free after this, right?/ Hey Haru, you're free after this, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:17.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I am, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.70,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:20.21,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:21.17,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(352,356)}Let's go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:24.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,See you again tomorrow, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:52.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Again... {thought start}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:56.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I get anxious whenever sunset comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:00.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:05.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm anxious about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:08.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Something as I see the sunset... {thought end.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.81,0:06:28.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:52.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Today, for the first time, I dated Haru-kun.			{thought start}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:56.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That day was just like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:07:00.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even when we rode the boat, I thought about the kiss...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:07.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then Haru-kun looked at me, and smiled brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:21.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was looking at the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:24.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They looked as if they were about to fall... {The stars looked like they were about to fall...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:31.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And there was someone beside me... {thought end} {And there was someone beside me... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:45.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:13.55,Nanatsuiro[ED2]Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}kizuite hora kira kira hikaru hoshi kuzu no youni
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:13.55,Nanatsuiro[ED2]English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Please notice just like the light from the stardust
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:37.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:40.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:06.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:08.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the Gardening Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:15.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:19.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why is Tsuwabuki-kun, on a Sunday...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:29.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking that maybe I'll remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:35.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I... What was I doing in the Gardening Club? {What was I doing in the Gardening Club?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:36.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You were...{TL check please.} {You know... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:40.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,pulling out weeds and watering flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:43.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We even did things like planting acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:45.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Acorns?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:51.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:53.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:57.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There was a time when you made the sprinkler. {fixed - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun did a really good-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:05.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing, so I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:09.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on a second.{Wait a second/bit/sec.} {Wait a second.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:10.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see, a handkerchief...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:18.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I have...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:28.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hold out your finger. {Put out your finger.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:49.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Um...{does "eto" have to be translated into something?}{Since it comes out a lot when Sumomo speaks, yes. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:57.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Tsuwabuki-kun. {T-Tsuwabuki-kun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:10:59.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to see the greenhouse? {Would you like to see the green house?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:01.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You might remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.23,0:11:04.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers are very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:09.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,At night, it's like a planetarium.{It looks like a planetarium at night. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:10.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There are lots of stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:12.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Planetarium?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:21.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, there's somewhere I need to go to right now.{Sorry, there is a place I need to go came up right now.}{Sorry, I just remembered I had to go somewhere.   TL check please?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:22.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:41.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're as clumsy as usual. {You're as clumsy as usual. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:45.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aspalas-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:49.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:12:01.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's a medicine I made with the star drops I've collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:04.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Medicine? How... {Medicine? How...}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drops that are important to Aspalas-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:08.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:14.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, if you let Tsuwabuki-kun drink this, he will regain his memory of loving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I just know it.{Undoubtably} {Undoubtedly.} {For sure. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:21.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's the most important thing right now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it all along...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:27.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,...that Nona-chan was a nice person. {That Nona-chan was a nice person...}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:28.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it a long time ago. {I knew it a long time ago.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:35.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But you know, I'll be okay without the medicine. {Aiko: this needs to be changed to something like i wont' use it} {But you know, I'll be fine without this, I think. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:44.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun will definitely keep the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:49.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Until then, I'll keep waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:52.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what the promise was, {I dont know what the promise was but,}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:55.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,but he forgot everything, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:58.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For Nona-chan's feelings, I'm happy. {I'm happy for Nona-chan's feelings. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:01.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll keep it as a precious charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:07.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even from now on, you'll be my friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:10.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You-... {You-...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.11,0:13:12.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.53,0:13:13.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're too nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:21.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't want to lose to that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:23.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Being the daughter of a genius...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:26.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Because of that, she was overflowing with talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It was unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:30.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But, I understand now... {But, I understand now,}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...the reason why I lost to that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:37.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What I was lacking wasn't talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:41.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It was that kindness. {TL check please.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.73,0:13:48.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We'll always be friends, Nona-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:11.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The Planetarium. {Planetarium.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:18.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was probably here before.{Probably I, was here before.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:29.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:44.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We were walking together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:02.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:38.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That person was always with me. {That person was always with me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:41.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:24.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why do I long for something?{Why is it so yearnful.}{Why do I long for something..? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That girl definitely...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}rode on this merry-go-round.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:54.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:56.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Cute... {Cute.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:01.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I loved that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:02.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I definitely did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:09.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Keisuke, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:12.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you know who that girl is, right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:19.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In that moment, I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:21.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,that I've typed this name countless times. {I have typed this name a countless amount of times.} {I have typed this name countless of times before. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:24.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:39.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:43.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to see the greenhouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.73,0:18:41.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This song...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun's pocket...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:26.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was a magical pocket. {Was a magical pocket.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:30.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The memory of us secretly hidden...{The memory of us was secretly hiding} {The memory of us is secretly hiding,}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:34.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's also hiding in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:36.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Star-sama...{Mr. stars,}{Mr. Stars,}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.69,0:19:37.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The planetarium...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And the merry-go-round.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:44.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,They are all held there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:47.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Our treasures...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:56.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun. {Haru-kun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:08.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:20.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I've definitely called Akihime by Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Always by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:27.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The acorn that was a stray...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:06.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It finally bloomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:10.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Together... Together we planted it... {We planted it together.}{We planted it together.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:12.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:15.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:21.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I love you. {I love you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.65,0:21:24.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What has happened, I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:26.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Not even one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But my heart remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:32.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I love Sumomo. {I love Sumomo.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:40.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:48.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know when I started loving you. {I don't know when I started loving you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.67,0:21:51.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So I, about Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:55.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll love you once again...{I'll once again, love/like you.} {I'll once again, love you.  TL check please.} {I'll, once again, love you. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:57.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,from the very beginning. {From the beginning.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.59,0:24:01.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.52,0:24:04.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,when looking at the stars outside the window...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.78,0:24:05.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.95,0:24:08.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,when writing in the secret journal about the day...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:14.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Mysterious things suddenly fall down from the sky. {Mysterious things suddenly fall down from the sky.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:20.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The key to everything are the star drops that fall down from the night sky, and... {The key to everything are the star drops that fall down from the night sky, and...}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.51,0:24:22.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,a special girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.64,0:24:28.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It is a magical story of, "A seven colored first love that encompasses you." {A slight mystic story of a seven-colored first love.} {A slightly magical story of a seven-colored first love. - megu}{Comment: nanatsuiro no hatsukoi? - megu}
